      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"moment.\" i feel like the damage is done. every time i see my dad's face, i just see what he gave up for me, and i know i didn't make it worth it. if i could just go back and fix things or... i don't know. it feels like the only way to stop feeling this shame is to just not be part of the picture anymore. if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to deal with me failing them. they could just remember the version of me that actually made them proud.",
